Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I carry high my craven flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,my ally I'm gonna fly and let my struggles\Nshoot me through the sky It'd be a pity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If we lingered here and let our pretty\Nsparks of life blend aloud and disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be fog that even you can't\Nnavigate If someone strong like you is lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,then who will set me straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Because when the waves cast,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.76,0:00:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,my heart adrift It's been your\Nkindness and your strength
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That would free me from\Nthe mist And just like that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We move on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.46,0:00:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail to a new dawn Weigh anchor,\Nride as high as you can I assure,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need anger I go fast as I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.42,0:00:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah I hear you laughing like you're numb\Nto it all But we're dashing together No,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.16,0:00:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we're never gonna fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.82,0:00:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the whole world may\Nnow be my enemy. Water's slow,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.06,0:01:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but I ain't backing down\Nso long as I'm free,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.76,0:01:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah So don't give it, come\Nride the current with me All in,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.46,0:01:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,wake up bright and early,\Nmaking for the peak we go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.72,0:01:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.34,0:02:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle atop the Skull\NDome has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner was previously Carrot,\Nbut now the outcome has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.78,0:02:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me. Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.44,0:02:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys really did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.42,0:02:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved the land of Wado!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.32,0:02:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You were amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.20,0:02:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.24,0:03:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The skyboats are flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.48,0:03:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen this sight in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.96,0:03:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.38,0:03:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy defeated Kaido and\Nburied him deep in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.08,0:03:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The capital is safe at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.58,0:03:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke turned into a dragon\Nand stopped Onigashima from falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.62,0:03:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.30,0:03:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That dragon was Lord Momonosuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.62,0:03:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.80,0:03:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A Devil Fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.64,0:03:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty long years we have waited.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.00,0:03:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The vengeance in our hearts has burned\Nhotter, brighter than any flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.26,0:03:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Until this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It is our victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.18,0:03:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm down to the emperors of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.72,0:04:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I really thought we were all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.12,0:04:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.14,0:04:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, nya, nya, nya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.86,0:04:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.86,0:04:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Always feels good to hunt big game
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.40,0:04:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, well, I feel like crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.54,0:04:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my goodness, you're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.44,0:05:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.74,0:05:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.18,0:05:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.88,0:05:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Shaw, I really won?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.98,0:05:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That crazy rubber bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.96,0:05:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.60,0:05:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me beat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.06,0:05:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Big Brown!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.86,0:05:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.40,0:05:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We made you do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.22,0:05:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We told him that we won!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He said it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.36,0:05:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone pushed themselves to the limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.82,0:05:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like my job's only starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.60,0:05:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.58,0:05:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They soon need your help right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.54,0:05:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro's out and he won't wake up! Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.82,0:05:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, please help us! OK. Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.18,0:06:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, we need your hands out! Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, the wound reopens!\NDr., please! Ow! Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.34,0:06:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, I'm dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.54,0:06:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyagi, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There are too many patients!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.98,0:06:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.34,0:06:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here for you, Gaara.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.90,0:06:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We scoured the whole castle\Nfor medical supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.82,0:06:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope we have enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.02,0:06:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile in the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.16,0:06:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the fire festival comes to a\Nclose as the sky boats float away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.86,0:06:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.94,0:06:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly high!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.96,0:06:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.90,0:06:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.54,0:06:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard my dad used to be real important.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew he'd die if he got caught,\Nand that's just what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.58,0:07:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But he didn't get tricked or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.38,0:07:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They said he got caught on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.98,0:07:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't my daddy do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.16,0:07:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Yasui wanted to give\Nus a chance to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.48,0:07:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He wanted to save our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.12,0:07:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If he hadn't made that decision,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.90,0:07:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,every little flame of\Nhope that we lit over
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.02,0:07:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the last 20 years would\Nhave been snuffed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cover your children's eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.04,0:07:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, the final daimyo to serve Kozuki,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.50,0:07:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,or rather, the happy-go-lucky fool from\NEbisu-Town makes his final journey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.48,0:08:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,His death was a noble sacrifice, One\Nthat ensured the land of Wano's future.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He and his allies wanted\Nto create a country
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.90,0:08:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,where you could be safe\Nand happy every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.66,0:08:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He did all that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.64,0:08:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.52,0:08:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.32,0:08:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you eat that fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.50,0:08:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you never to eat those?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.22,0:08:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.32,0:08:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.32,0:09:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I have some, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.90,0:09:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, you've got some real talent!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.30,0:09:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you'll be the best dancer in the\Nland of Wano someday! You think? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, he just wants me\Nto live a happy life?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll change the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That looked good to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.90,0:09:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he'll love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.72,0:09:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,As a samurai, and as a father,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:10:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,there could be no greater\Nhonor, no greater joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And away you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.12,0:10:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sunisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Zunesha, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I have thought it over carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.58,0:10:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.74,0:10:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't open the borders yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.40,0:10:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I will defer to your wisdom on the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.20,0:10:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I have faith in you, friend. I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't celebrate yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, we still remember you, samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too late to surrender, or\Nelse we're going to blast you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that Commander Kaido lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.12,0:11:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And an emperor's crew won't lose either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.38,0:11:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.29,0:11:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't know when to quit, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.14,0:11:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you punks want to fight, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.40,0:11:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I got the bloody left in the sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.90,0:11:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.18,0:11:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of me, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.74,0:11:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Space pirates, lay down your arms at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You not only lost to your enemy, you\Nwould have died if not for their aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.68,0:11:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,When Kaido was defeated,\Nhis clouds vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.36,0:11:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think stopped\Nthis island from falling?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.84,0:11:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ko, Zu, Ki, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.26,0:11:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The leader of our troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.06,0:11:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So what you're saying is your enemy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.30,0:11:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That will be your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.06,0:12:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You awano your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.60,0:12:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,if you bare your fangs at Lord Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.14,0:12:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be happy to take what he's due.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.52,0:12:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening? An earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.82,0:12:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole island is shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.46,0:12:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.12,0:12:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Abunuki, sir! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.14,0:12:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's happening in the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.86,0:12:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Put it on the screen! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.54,0:12:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one damn thing after another!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.82,0:12:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there, you idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Go check on it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.98,0:13:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle in the sky has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner, previously Kaido,\Nis now Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.88,0:13:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,An eruption?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.22,0:13:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It was close to Udon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.78,0:13:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That must have been the\Nrumble we just felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.90,0:13:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.42,0:13:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.38,0:13:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.38,0:13:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's coming his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.20,0:13:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.26,0:14:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not a crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.02,0:14:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,it's kaido but why this\Nisn't fair this is the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.62,0:14:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,only day of the year we're\Nfree from that monster
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.58,0:14:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone listen i am not kaido
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.98,0:14:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That eruption was nothing more\Nthan Kaido's final farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.22,0:14:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The leader of the Beast\NPirates has fallen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.46,0:14:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragon just disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.72,0:14:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.96,0:14:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a person!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:14:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,How many of them are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.90,0:15:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Kubra-Sakia!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.56,0:15:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But we just had her funeral!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.78,0:15:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me that she's a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.98,0:15:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be some kind of trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't fake beauty like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss Kyoshiro?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.28,0:15:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what happened to your pompadour?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.60,0:15:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.02,0:15:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.96,0:15:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.10,0:15:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.98,0:15:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Monique!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.34,0:16:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you've got it all wrong! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.46,0:16:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.62,0:16:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragon wasn't him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.44,0:16:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.92,0:16:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean there are two dragons?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss Kiyoshiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.92,0:16:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Komurasaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.26,0:16:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks just like her, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.02,0:16:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on in front of the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.98,0:16:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss Kiyoshiro, you gotta explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.16,0:16:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of you have become quite famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.08,0:16:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wonder if they'll\Nremember the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It has been 20 years after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.44,0:16:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.35,0:16:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.60,0:16:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.22,0:17:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Foxfire Kin'emon? But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.84,0:17:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he was dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They said he burned along with the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.98,0:17:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Some sort of trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.86,0:17:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming or not, I\Ndon't want to miss this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like something\Namazing is about to happen
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.30,0:17:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.82,0:17:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiyukasuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.06,0:17:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kawamatsu Makapa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.08,0:17:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Dogstorm!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.94,0:17:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Raizo of the Mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.50,0:17:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Cat Viper and...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.82,0:17:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Kikunojo of the Fallen Snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.56,0:17:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, what is this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.54,0:18:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,To start, Napping Kyoshiro was a\Nfalse name to obscure my identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.62,0:18:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In truth, though my face has changed, I\Nam a member of the Akazaya 9, Denjiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.48,0:18:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here in the flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.10,0:18:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The legendary samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.66,0:18:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They came back for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.82,0:18:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought I would see the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.72,0:18:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since I was little,\NI thought they were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Toki was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.96,0:18:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Her last words were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.68,0:18:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is one hell of a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.76,0:18:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the light scroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.90,0:18:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to broadcast this right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.58,0:18:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let the whole country know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.56,0:18:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A broadcast from the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.52,0:19:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's happening at the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.28,0:19:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this about the earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.34,0:19:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the whole region was done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.96,0:19:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, forget about the damn broadcast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.90,0:19:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, wait, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.62,0:19:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,what's going on there's a message\Nfrom the capital we're about to watch
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.42,0:19:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,now start off the light scroll
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.34,0:19:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,your
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.08,0:19:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,kind of son yep that's me you're
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.86,0:19:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,looking for a beat down stop resisting\Nyou know we won huh don't you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.82,0:19:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,try anything funny because we are super\Ntired and we will probably No, no, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.12,0:19:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not your enemy! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.56,0:19:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been following your story in\Nthe newspaper for quite some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:20:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Though in person, you're a little\Nmore unusual-looking than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.74,0:20:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.26,0:20:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one with horns, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.06,0:20:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're Kaido's son, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.40,0:20:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.16,0:20:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.20,0:20:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Yamato, but you\Nmay also call me Kozan Gioden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.92,0:20:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I will be joining your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.46,0:20:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.72,0:20:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.26,0:20:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're gonna join\Nthe Straw Hats? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.10,0:20:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-ho-ho, glad to have you aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.68,0:20:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Really glad to have you aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a funny one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.80,0:20:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't personally object, but our\Ncaptain is the one who has the final word.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.76,0:20:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to run it by him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.56,0:20:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope he's okay after all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:21:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The way he fought gave\Nme chills! It was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.50,0:21:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He was so free!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.02,0:21:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just whoosh! Bang! Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.06,0:21:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All over the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.48,0:21:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He was incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.94,0:21:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.72,0:21:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we gotta go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.02,0:21:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll definitely do the same to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.00,0:21:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, scornbags!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.12,0:21:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.98,0:21:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say you could go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.38,0:21:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want to be slaves, young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.92,0:21:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move or I'll pound your faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.96,0:21:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.92,0:21:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unbecoming of a soldier to flee.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.18,0:21:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll take this like a man. You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.90,0:21:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like they're not our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.92,0:21:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, speaking of which, what's\Ngoing to happen to the two of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.84,0:21:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to say, my power will\Nwear off when the same moon rises.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.84,0:21:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So, it'll take a whole month?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.64,0:21:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.04,0:21:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes when the animals\Nturn back to normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.20,0:22:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,they decide they don't\Nwant to be friends anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.10,0:22:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But others decide to hang\Naround and stay buddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.70,0:22:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.64,0:22:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it depends on their personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.80,0:22:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess in the end, they just\Nchoose whatever makes them happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.14,0:22:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.28,0:22:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.58,0:22:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be happy if we can\Nstay just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.24,0:22:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Selena?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.52,0:22:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy if you stayed with me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.16,0:22:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But not as a servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.94,0:22:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe more like a mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.88,0:22:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That way we can be together forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.20,0:22:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.82,0:22:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.04,0:22:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.98,0:22:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,\Nyou've truly brought me joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.18,0:22:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.64,0:22:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But can you hold me a\Nlittle less tight, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.00,0:23:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.78,0:23:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm choking up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.20,0:23:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.84,0:23:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They're kneeling down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.75,0:23:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I think someone else is about to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.32,0:23:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on. Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.00,0:23:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,it's been 20 years since\Nmy father Kozuki Oden
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.44,0:23:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Died, father? It can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.72,0:23:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,be you have endured many
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.50,0:23:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,hardships but those\Ndays have come to an end
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.76,0:24:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,the fire festival will\Ncontinue you may carry
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.20,0:24:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,On however you please,\Nyou may drink as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.94,0:24:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As you like. Wait, really?\NWell, water will be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.24,0:24:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,of charge the factories\Nwill not be allowed to
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.30,0:24:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,poison the land and no\None shall live as a slave
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.14,0:24:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that... Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.96,0:24:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Your suffering is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.50,0:24:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Four more died at the factory today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.74,0:24:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Might be me tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.88,0:24:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone has to tell Utama.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.24,0:25:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Utama, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.66,0:25:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mother and father aren't coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.72,0:25:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, Dad, you can rest in peace, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.84,0:25:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be just fine, I promise. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.32,0:25:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't! You're tickling me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.54,0:25:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Logan hats for sale!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.88,0:25:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Does anybody need a hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.68,0:25:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Quality guaranteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.64,0:25:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't find a better deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.50,0:25:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need a new hat, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.78,0:25:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.56,0:25:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Find woven hats for sale!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.02,0:25:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll protect you from the snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.60,0:26:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.90,0:26:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't sell any hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.58,0:26:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.84,0:26:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just try again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.94,0:26:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,May I have a hat, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.02,0:26:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a tingle!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.36,0:26:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you an orphan?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.06,0:26:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You must stay strong
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.10,0:26:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a few years more. The samurai of the\NKozuki clan will return to the land of
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.46,0:27:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wano And the demons who took control of\Nthis country Will be brought to justice
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.86,0:27:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They will.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.60,0:27:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll work hard till then.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.86,0:27:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be strong like the\Nsamurai from the Kozuki clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.52,0:27:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All I gotta do is keep believing!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.18,0:27:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.72,0:27:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.96,0:27:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.00,0:27:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.04,0:27:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make this a normal thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.64,0:27:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear that by the time we leave Wano,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.82,0:27:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll be a place where you can\Neat as much as you want every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.20,0:28:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You need not fear Orochi or Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.64,0:28:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Their reign of terror is finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.74,0:28:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I traveled the seas and made\Npowerful new friends. With the
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.16,0:28:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninja Pirate Mink Samurai Alliance.\NWe raided Onigashima, Orochi,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.62,0:28:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido, and the Beast Pirates We faced all\Nthe evils that threatened this country
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.16,0:28:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the end, we emerged victorious
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.14,0:28:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean you took on those\Nmonsters and actually won?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.58,0:28:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't have to bow to the owner anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.90,0:28:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not in a damned alliance!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.86,0:28:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean we're gonna\Nbe happy every day now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.98,0:29:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray! We got her!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.92,0:29:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I definitely imagined you could\Nescape from this nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.76,0:29:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.67,0:29:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.70,0:29:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Our fallen allies who helped us save\Nthis land will never be forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.72,0:29:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.90,0:29:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What else should I say to my people?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.32,0:29:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this is your time to show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.64,0:29:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you, a figurehead? Hamomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.96,0:30:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything left in the\Nworld that can scare you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.68,0:30:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The name that my father gave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.70,0:30:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,means peerless among men!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.28,0:30:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Under my rule, this broken land\Nshall become a paradise on Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.70,0:30:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Lend me your strength, and let\Nus work toward this end together!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.70,0:30:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,For I have traveled twenty years\Nthrough time to save this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.82,0:30:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,From this day forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.66,0:30:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Kozuki Momonosuke, will\Nlead the land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.28,0:30:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.84,0:31:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I will keep my promise to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.10,0:31:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, I will follow in your footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.70,0:31:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to run out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.34,0:31:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The Closity clan is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.58,0:32:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a real Shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.42,0:32:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for you\Nfor so long! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.72,0:32:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got my escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.36,0:32:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A new dawn breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.56,0:32:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The warriors sheathe their swords and\Nflower petals flutter in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.18,0:32:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The land of Samarai's new leader, a\Nhandsome young man of eight years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.86,0:32:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,gazes to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.32,0:32:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He is not a man of great strength, but\Nhe is loyal and kind like no one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.38,0:32:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Momonosuke steps\Nforth as the land of
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.54,0:32:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wano's proud shogun, with\Nhis samurai at his side,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.56,0:32:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,he will forge his place in history
